      "description": "Watch Newcastle vs Liverpool highlights and goals from Premier League International Cup on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 23, 2026. Intense Showdown at the Premier League International Cup Anticipation filled the air for this Premier League International Cup fixture held on August 23, 2026 . As the two sides locked horns, the stage was set for a classic football match defined by high stakes and tactical maneuvering. The home side drew first blood when Anthony Elanga found the net just 5 minutes into the game, set up beautifully by Amar Dedic and William Osula . The early breakthrough injected energy into the game, leading to a gritty first half characterized by physical challenges and several yellow cards for both teams. A Dramatic Conclusion The tempo remained high into the second half , where Cody Gakpo leveled the score for Liverpool in the 55th minute following a setup from Ryan Gravenberch . The parity lasted only briefly as Joseph Willock regained the lead for Newcastle with a clinical finish in the 57th minute. The game turned into a tactical chess match, with substitutions shaping the closing stages as Liverpool chased an elusive equalizer. The decisive turning point arrived deep into stoppage time. Lewis Hall tripped Victor Munoz in the box, gifting the visitors a penalty. Dominik Szoboszlai stepped up and calmly slotted home in the 90+9 minute, ensuring that the points were shared in a thrilling end to a competitive day of sports ."
